#: scripts/scenario_62_chaos_of_war.lua:5595
msgctxt "msgGM"
msgid ""
"This is where you determine the kinds of ships the players will use.\n"
"\n"
"Default: There is a default set of ships depending on the number of players "
"and the number of teams.\n"
"\n"
"Spawned: Whatever is spawned from the first screen for one team will be "
"replicated for the other team or teams. If the number of ships spawned does "
"not match the team size selected, the default player ship set will be used.\n"
"\n"
"Custom: There are several sets of defaults under custom: Warp (ships "
"equipped with warp drive), Jump (ships equipped with jump drive), Light "
"(ships that are not as heavily armed or armored) and Heavy (ships that are "
"more heavily armed or armored). There is also custom button where you can "
"select the ship or ships you want from a list. To set up the list, use the "
"+Customize Custom button."
msgstr ""

